[{"id":2631630368,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6c234g","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103100#pullrequestreview-2631630368","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103100","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-02-21T01:47:10Z"},{"id":2631631682,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6c24NC","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103100#pullrequestreview-2631631682","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103100","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-02-21T01:48:43Z"},{"id":2631667059,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6c3A1z","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nLinux x86_64 release export template stripped binary size (`production=yes lto=full`):\r\n\r\n- Default: 72,126,160 bytes\r\n- `vulkan=no`: 69,537,616 bytes\r\n- `vulkan=no opengl3=no`: 67,690,552 bytes\r\n- `rendering_device=no`: 62,368,304 bytes\r\n- `rendering_device=no opengl3=no`: 60,611,224 bytes\r\n  - The resulting binary doesn't include any rendering drivers but will still try to spawn a window (and fail with an error; see below). I suppose it should automatically run in headless mode instead to mimic 3.x's headless binaries, but that can be done in a future PR.\r\n\r\nWhen you disable all RenderingDevice drivers for the target platform, `rendering_device=no` should be implied so you get the smallest possible binary size (unless there is a reason to keep it I'm not aware of).\r\n\r\nOn Linux and Android, this is the case when using `vulkan=no`. On Windows, this is the case with `vulkan=no d3d12=no`, and on macOS/iOS, this is the case with `vulkan=no metal=no`. The web platform should always imply `rendering_device=no`.\r\n\r\nError when running a binary with no rendering drivers:\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64 --path /tmp/test_empty_project                                               \r\nERROR: No renderers available.\r\n   at: setup (main/main.cpp:2249)\r\nGodot Engine v4.4.beta.custom_build.b8c37952b (2025-02-21 00:13:28 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\nERROR: Video driver not found.\r\n   at: DisplayServerX11 (platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp:6883)\r\nWARNING: Display driver x11 failed, falling back to wayland.\r\n     at: setup2 (main/main.cpp:3017)\r\nERROR: Can't connect to a Wayland display.\r\n   at: init (platform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_thread.cpp:3909)\r\nERROR: Could not initialize the Wayland thread.\r\n   at: DisplayServerWayland (platform/linuxbsd/wayland/display_server_wayland.cpp:1421)\r\nERROR: Can't create the Wayland display server.\r\n   at: create_func (platform/linuxbsd/wayland/display_server_wayland.cpp:1395)\r\nERROR: Unable to create DisplayServer, all display drivers failed.\r\nUse \"--headless\" command line argument to run the engine in headless mode if this is desired (e.g. for continuous integration).\r\n   at: setup2 (main/main.cpp:3027)\r\nWARNING: ObjectDB instances leaked at exit (run with --verbose for details).\r\n     at: cleanup (core/object/object.cpp:2378)\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen running the same binary with `--headless`, an error is printed but the program keeps on running correctly:\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64 --path /tmp/test_empty_project --headless\r\nERROR: No renderers available.\r\n   at: setup (main/main.cpp:2249)\r\nGodot Engine v4.4.beta.custom_build.b8c37952b (2025-02-21 00:13:28 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103100#pullrequestreview-2631667059","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103100","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-02-21T02:24:32Z"},{"id":2706537698,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hUnzi","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"Looks good overall! I don't love the added boilerplate and hacks but the size gains are worth it, and the hacks are still reasonable.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103100#pullrequestreview-2706537698","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103100","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-21T17:08:58Z"},{"id":2706976726,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hWS_W","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","login":"dsnopek","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103100#pullrequestreview-2706976726","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103100","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-03-21T18:56:57Z"},{"id":2706982306,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hWUWi","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","login":"dsnopek","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103100#pullrequestreview-2706982306","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103100","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-03-21T18:59:35Z"},{"id":2707001441,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hWZBh","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://